WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.849 --> 00:00:05.430
Avengers: Infinity War directors Joe and Anthony
Russo went out of their way to implore fans

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.410
and critics not to spoil the film's many twists.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.930
So it's surprising that we've already learned
a great deal about what might take place in

00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.600
2019's Avengers 4.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.910
While some potential spoilers are just rumors
from questionable sources, others are slip-ups

00:00:17.910 --> 00:00:21.670
from Marvel actors, or even appear in official
Marvel publications.

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:25.980
Here's a look at all the Avengers 4 rumors
and spoilers leaked so far.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:26.980
Time travel

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:31.550
Leaked set photos from the filming of Avengers
4 have shown actors wearing some vintage outfits

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.999
- namely, their costumes from 2012's first
Avengers film.

00:00:34.999 --> 00:00:39.670
In fact, Marvel has even recreated sets from
the film's epic Battle of New York sequence.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:43.819
This has led many to speculate that Avengers
4 will involve time travel.

00:00:43.819 --> 00:00:45.839
"Great Scott!"

00:00:45.839 --> 00:00:46.839
And that makes sense.

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:51.149
We know from Avengers: Infinity War that Doctor
Strange used the Time Stone to peer into possible

00:00:51.149 --> 00:00:55.429
futures and set a kind of plan in motion - and
we also know that in his own film, he used

00:00:55.429 --> 00:00:58.100
the Time Stone's powers to reverse time and
save the world.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:00.059
Hey, they don't call him The Doctor for nothing!

00:01:00.059 --> 00:01:02.179
Hawkeye will become Ronin

00:01:02.179 --> 00:01:06.180
Thanks to leaked set photos showing Jeremy
Renner wearing some black and gold boots under

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:10.240
his trenchcoat, it's been all but confirmed
that Clint Barton will shed the Hawkeye moniker

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:15.619
and adopt the Ronin persona in Avengers 4,
something he did in the comics back in 2007's

00:01:15.619 --> 00:01:16.990
New Avengers #30.

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:21.390
Renner, of course, was infamously missing
from Avengers: Infinity War, after his character

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:25.700
took a plea deal following the events of Captain
America: Civil War in order to protect his

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:26.700
family.

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.880
Fans are speculating that when Thanos snapped
his fingers, Hawkeye's wife and kids were

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:34.429
among the victims, leading him to return to
action in his new, dark identity.

00:01:34.429 --> 00:01:36.750
Tony Stark builds his own Infinity Gauntlet

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:40.920
The plot of Avengers: Infinity War contained
so many shocks and surprises, nobody could

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:42.380
possibly have guessed them all.

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:46.860
Yet an anonymous user on the website 4chan
came pretty darn close, correctly predicting

00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:50.799
such specific details as the return of the
Red Skull, and the fact that Thanos would

00:01:50.799 --> 00:01:53.369
sacrifice Gamora to obtain the Soul Gem.

00:01:53.369 --> 00:01:57.450
Some believe that the user must have inside
sources, so people are paying close attention

00:01:57.450 --> 00:02:01.200
to the mysterious user's latest batch of rumors
for Avengers 4.

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:05.369
"Iron Man reassembles the Avengers and decides
to build his own Infinity Gauntlet to undo

00:02:05.369 --> 00:02:06.990
everything that Thanos did.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:10.880
They recruit Ant-Man to help them travel through
time and space using the Quantum Realm to

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:13.680
retrieve the Infinity Stones from different
time periods.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:17.250
Thanos finds out about their plans and becomes
hellbent on stopping them.

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:20.690
The movie revolves around the relationship
between Captain America and Iron Man."

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:26.030
This claim seems to be backed up by set photos
showing Ant-Man alongside 2012-era Cap - or

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:29.790
is it possible the theory is simply based
on the photos to begin with?

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:30.790
Hmm.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.730
So what does Anonymous claim will happen with
Stark's new Infinity Gauntlet?

00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:35.190
Glad you asked…

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.740
Professor Hulk will wield the 'Stark Gauntlet'

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:42.110
One piece of promotional art for Avengers
4 has supposedly been leaked online.

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:46.590
Whether or not it's real is a matter of speculation,
but a potentially interesting detail is the

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:49.720
portrayal of the Hulk, who is wearing clothes
and looks almost human.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:53.630
This supports fan theories that the internal
battle between Hulk and Dr. Bruce Banner that

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:57.570
raged throughout Avengers: Infinity War will
end up with the two personalities merging

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.470
to create Professor Hulk, a version of the
character from the comics that combines Banner's

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:03.160
mind with Hulk's body.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:07.550
And according to 4chan tipster Anonymous,
Professor Hulk plays a vital role in Avengers

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:08.550
4.

00:03:08.550 --> 00:03:12.170
"Hulk's subplot centers on Banner and Hulk
finally merging to become Professor Hulk.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:16.490
He is the one that ultimately wields the Stark
Gauntlet against Thanos, losing his arm in

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:17.800
the process."

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:19.420
The death of Steve Rogers

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:22.990
The death of Steve Rogers has been rumored
and anticipated for years.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:26.590
Star Chris Evans has been forthcoming about
the fact that his contract is up and he wants

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:27.790
to do other things.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:32.170
Most fans expected Captain America to die
during Captain America: Civil War, since that's

00:03:32.170 --> 00:03:33.400
what happened in the comics.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.430
So far, though, he's still going strong.

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:40.580
But many expect Steve Rogers to finally meet
his end in Avengers 4, and the anonymous 4chan

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:42.520
spoiler claims to know how it's going to happen.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.740
"At one point, Captain America and Thor fight
Thanos.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.670
Timeline alterations have restored Mjolnir,
and Cap wields it against Thanos to allow

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:52.730
the others to escape, and is killed holding
Thanos off."

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:56.580
These are just predictions and rumors at this
stage, but the way Cap's arc has been going

00:03:56.580 --> 00:04:00.310
seems to indicate that he's going to go out
with some kind of grand sacrifice, and dying

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:03.440
in order to save half the universe certainly
fits the bill.

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.180
Iron Man has a kid

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:09.010
Seeing as this Avengers 4 leak came directly
from the mouth of Gwyneth Paltrow, it seems

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.280
almost certain that Tony Stark will be a daddy
in Avengers 4.

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:16.160
In an interview for the official Avengers:
Infinity War magazine, Paltrow revealed that

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:20.710
her character, Tony Stark's longtime love
interest Pepper Potts, was destined to become

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:21.710
a mother.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:23.990
"Pepper and Tony have had a real long journey
together.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:28.190
She obviously starts as his dutiful assistant,
and then the relationship evolves, and now

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:30.380
this decade later they're married, and they
have a child.

00:04:30.380 --> 00:04:34.300
Their relationship has evolved in all of the
ways that great romances evolve."

00:04:34.300 --> 00:04:38.100
The first question raised here is, "How did
this spoiler make it to print in an official

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.100
Marvel magazine?"

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:42.290
The second question is, "Does this mean there's
going to be a time jump?"

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:46.021
Sure, the baby might be born at the end of
Avengers 4 as a symbol of renewal and new

00:04:46.021 --> 00:04:50.020
life - and if that happens, bet the house
on the kid being named Steve in honor of Captain

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:51.020
America.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:54.880
But it's also possible that Avengers 4 will
start some years in the future, with Tony

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:56.300
and Pepper already parents.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:05:00.740
If so, jumping back in time to change the
past could carry devastating implications

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:04.820
for Tony: changing the timestream might save
half the population of the universe, but at

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.090
the cost of erasing his own child from existence.

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:09.090
Group shot

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:14.880
In April, 2018, Winter Soldier actor Sebastian
Stan accidentally dropped a spoiler for Avengers

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.870
4 when he revealed there was a scene featuring
every character.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:21.180
"There was one scene, I think, we had where
everybody was there.

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:24.510
I can't really talk about that scene, but
I knew it took them three months in planning

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:26.280
this scene to have everyone there.

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:30.220
You look around and you just saw everyone
from Samuel L. Jackson to Michael Douglas

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:31.870
to Michelle Pfeiffer.

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:32.870
Everybody was there."

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:36.280
Stan wasn't the only one who mentioned filming
this sequence, either, as Scarlett Johansson

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:39.860
mentioned it as well during an appearance
on The Late Show with Stephen Colbert.

00:05:39.860 --> 00:05:43.100
"I think in one particular scene, there's
like thirty-two of us.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.100
There's a lot.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:48.280
There's so many of us, I don't even know who's
a Marvel character and who's like, a crew

00:05:48.520 --> 00:05:49.560
member."

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:54.300
Since there was no scene like this in Avengers:
Infinity War, it must take place in Avengers

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.300
4.

00:05:55.300 --> 00:05:59.020
And since Winter Soldier - and Samuel L. Jackson's
Nick Fury - both died from Thanos's finger

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:03.040
snap in Infinity War, we have to wonder just
how they manage to bring everyone together

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.040
at all.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:05.040
Hmm!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:07.650
Did Zoe Saldana spoil the title?

00:06:07.650 --> 00:06:12.330
Marvel Studios head honcho made it clear early
on that the title of Avengers 4 was a closely

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:13.330
guarded secret.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:17.430
But that went out the window when Zoe Saldana
seemed to accidentally reveal the title of

00:06:17.430 --> 00:06:19.580
Avengers 4 on the red carpet, saying

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:24.850
"Infinity War is the first part, and we all
have to go back for Gauntlet later this year."

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:27.530
James Gunn told Yahoo! that she simply had her wires
crossed.

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.830
"It's not the title.

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.600
My guess is that Zoe just misspoke.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:35.000
I'll talk to Zoe today, but I would imagine
that is just Zoe misspeaking and saying Infinity

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.120
Gauntlet instead of Infinity War."

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:41.343
4chan's anonymous tipster indicated that this
wasn't the case, though, writing,

00:06:41.343 --> 00:06:45.150
"The title was Avengers: Infinity Gauntlet
at one point, but it might be changed after

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:47.990
Zoe Saldana accidentally leaked it."

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:49.360
Back from the dead

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:52.740
The fact that Tom Holland's Spider-Man and
Chadwick Boseman's Black Panther were wiped

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:56.800
out by Thanos despite both having sequels
on the way pretty much confirmed that at least

00:06:56.800 --> 00:07:00.620
some of the departed heroes will be brought
back to life in Avengers 4.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:03.860
Directors Joe and Anthony Russo have been
doing their best to throw us off the scent

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:07.669
by implying that the mass deaths at the end
of Infinity War are permanent, but it's hard

00:07:07.669 --> 00:07:11.360
to keep up that pretense when many of the
actors themselves are contradicting them.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:13.800
For instance, Drax actor Dave Bautista said

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:17.930
"I got a lot of texts saying, 'I can't believe
you're dead, your character is dead.

00:07:17.930 --> 00:07:21.520
They were really like heartbroken and I was
like, 'I'm gonna be in four, I'm gonna be

00:07:21.520 --> 00:07:22.530
in Guardians 3.'

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:25.840
I don't know how they're bringing me back,
yeah but somehow I'm going to make it because,

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:29.699
as far as I know, I am going to be in Guardians
3, so I have to be back."

00:07:29.699 --> 00:07:33.860
And Zoe Saldana told E! Live From the Red
Carpet that being sacrificed by her father

00:07:33.860 --> 00:07:37.110
Thanos felt like a "see you later" rather
than a true goodbye.

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:40.760
"I knew that we will have to all come back,
at some point this fall, and finish up the

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.580
fourth installment of Avengers."

00:07:42.580 --> 00:07:45.080
We can't wait to see how that finish plays
out.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:46.080
Thanks for watching!

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.780
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.770
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

